Since $K$ is odd, Walecki's theorem~\cite{lucas} implies that $\mathcal{R}_A$ has a Hamilton decomposition $C_{A,1}, \dots, C_{A,(K-1)/2}$, and similarly  $\mathcal{R}_B$
