More precisely,%
    \COMMENT{Andy: reworded} 
recall that $\mathcal{R}_A$ denotes the complete graph whose vertex set is $\{A_1, \dots, A_K \}$.
As mentioned above, $\mathcal{R}_A$ has a Hamilton decomposition $C_{A,1}, \dots, C_{A,(K-1)/2}$.%
